                <pb facs="0175" n="91" xml:id="pg91"/>

                <head>Treaty between the United States and China for the extension of the commercial
                    relations between them</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Shanghai, October 8, 1903.<lb/>Ratification
                        advised by the Senate, December 18, 1903.<lb/>Ratified by the President,
                        January 12, 1904.<lb/>Ratified by China, January 10, 1904.<lb/>Ratifications
                        exchanged at Washington, January 13, 1904.<lb/>Proclaimed, January 13,
                        1904.</hi></p>


